      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting B2 precipitates will be nanoscale, uniformly dispersed, and present both at grain boundaries and within the matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "An inverted BCC+B2 microstructure will significantly increase the room-temperature plastic strain to fracture of NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated NbMoTaW will retain approximately 400 MPa yield strength at 1600 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC5995863::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated material will retain irradiation resistance comparable to untreated NbMoTaW.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "B2 precipitates act as crack-deflection sites and enhance grain-boundary cohesion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Discrete B2 precipitates interrupt continuous brittle paths and thereby suppress premature crack propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "B2 precipitation enhances dislocation mobility at room temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A continuous BCC matrix preserves the alloy's intrinsic high-temperature yield strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Overall chemical homogeneity supports retention of irradiation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "RHEAs with a continuous ordered B2 matrix tend to have poor room-temperature ductility.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The ductility benefit requires the B2 precipitate size and volume fraction to remain within an optimal window.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excessive B2 precipitation could reduce strength or create undesirable stress concentrations.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The required thermal cycles must be compatible with the high melting points of Nb, Mo, Ta, and W.",
